results.statement:
**Lemma 1.3 (evaluation at the identity).** For every strictly decreasing integer tuple \(a\),
\[
\left.\frac{D_a}{D_\delta}\right|_{z_1=\cdots=z_n=1}
=\prod_{i<j}\frac{a_i-a_j}{j-i}>0. \tag{1.4}
\]

